SUMMARY:parkrun
LOCATION:Bishan-Ang Mo Kio Park
RRULE:FREQ=WEEKLY;BYDAY=SA
DESCRIPTION:Same event every week. Pick the one furthest from Tanjong Pagar
  rather than the nearest\, so turning up puts you somewhere else in Singap
 ore with the whole day ahead of you.\n\nWalking is allowed. There is no ti
 me limit and nobody finishes last.\n\nBishan-Ang Mo Kio / East Coast / Wes
 t Coast / Bay East / Bedok Reservoir. Register once at parkrun.sg - the ba
 rcode then works at 2\,000+ events worldwide\, Sheffield included.
