BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:anchor-mum@stu-bot
DTSTAMP:20260826T000000Z
DTSTART:20260902T143000
DTEND:20260902T151500
SUMMARY:Call Mum - walk while you talk
RRULE:FREQ=WEEKLY;BYDAY=WE
DESCRIPTION:About 07:00 for her. Kettle on\, nobody dressed.\n\nWhat moves 
 this off 30% is her expecting it\, not you remembering it. So tell her it 
 is every Wednesday\, and then it is hers to hold rather than yours.\n\nIf 
 you are late\, call anyway. Ten minutes at 15:20 beats a clean miss.
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:Call Mum - walk while you talk
TRIGGER:-PT15M
END:VALARM
